::recipe
conversion stage: initial

name: Tiramisù
source: https://publicdomainrecipes.com/tiramisu/
source author: pestanzul
source license: Public domain (Unlicense)
units: metric
category: dessert
tags: coffee, mascarpone, chilled
dietary: vegetarian
serves: 8
active time: ~20m
total time: ~3h20m
image: tiramisu.webp

::ingredients

(egg) 4
(sugar) 100g
(mascarpone) 500g
(savoiardi biscuits) 300g
(coffee, room temperature) as needed
(cocoa powder) as needed

::equipment

(bowl) 2
(baking tray)
(refrigerator)

::instructions

(egg: yolk) <separate>
(egg: white) <separate>

{cream} =
    (egg: yolk) +
    (sugar)

{cream} <beat>
    + (mascarpone)
    <stir, until uniform>

(egg: white) <beat, until stiff>

{cream} + (egg: white)
    <fold in, gradually, gently>

(baking tray) <layer, cream>

Repeat [
    (savoiardi biscuits) <soak, coffee>
        <layer, baking tray>
    {cream} <layer, baking tray>
]
until layers complete

# Source recommends rotating the second biscuit layer 90 degrees for stability.
(cocoa powder) <sprinkle, top>

{tiramisu} <refrigerate, 3h>
    <serve>
